Fix command injection in run_maintenance (CWE-78)

The TOOL verb interpolated the tool name from the request into a command line
and ran it through sh -c, so a name containing shell metacharacters ran
arbitrary commands as the server user. run_maintenance now matches the name against
the two tools it supports and answers them directly: there is no command
string, no Command and no shell, so no request input reaches a command
interpreter.
